      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Як користуватися Qwen Image 2.1",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note",
        "ue_properties": {
          "widget_ue_connectable": {},
          "version": "7.8",
          "input_ue_unconnectable": {}
        }
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Ref2image: up to 16 reference slots are pre-wired (image_1 … image_16, the node's maximum). Upload a photo in a LoadImage node and unmute it (Ctrl+M) to include it; slots that are not uploaded stay muted, so the graph runs with a single reference.\n\nThe first unmuted reference defines the output aspect ratio; resolution controls approximate area. Reference order follows the slot number, not upload order.\n\nT2image: remove the LoadImage nodes and their connections to images.image_1 … image_16. With no references, TextEncodeQwenImage21 returns a square 64-channel latent at resolution x resolution (0 falls back to 1024). Keep its latent output connected to KSampler.\n\nTurbo defaults: 8 steps, CFG 1, euler/simple, denoise 1. Negative prompt is inactive at CFG 1. Both LoRA strengths start at 0; the source file used strengths 1 and 3.\n\nThis graph uses the pinned official Comfy-Org Turbo, Qwen3-VL 8B encoder, and Qwen Image 2.1 VAE from this project. Requires ComfyUI 0.40.0.\n\nLoRA chain: 52 → 88 → 84 → 105…108 (realism, always in the image) → 109…113 (need a Civitai token at build, so they ship bypassed) → 85 KV cache. Un-bypass (Ctrl+B) a node and raise strength_model to use it; 0.7–1.0 suits Turbo at CFG 1."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "Ref2image: up to 16 reference slots are pre-wired (image_1 … image_16, the node's maximum). Upload a photo in a LoadImage node and unmute it (Ctrl+M) to include it; slots that are not uploaded stay muted, so the graph runs with a single reference.\n\nThe first unmuted reference defines the output aspect ratio; resolution controls approximate area. Reference order follows the slot number, not upload order.\n\nT2image: remove the LoadImage nodes and their connections to images.image_1 … image_16. With no references, TextEncodeQwenImage21 returns a square 64-channel latent at resolution x resolution (0 falls back to 1024). Keep its latent output connected to KSampler.\n\nTurbo defaults: 8 steps, CFG 1, euler/simple, denoise 1. Negative prompt is inactive at CFG 1. Both LoRA strengths start at 0; the source file used strengths 1 and 3.\n\nThis graph uses the pinned official Comfy-Org Turbo, Qwen3-VL 8B encoder, and Qwen Image 2.1 VAE from this project. Requires ComfyUI 0.40.0.\n\nLoRA chain: 52 → 88 → 84 → 105…108 (realism, always in the image) → 109…113 (need a Civitai token at build, so they ship bypassed) → 85 KV cache. Un-bypass (Ctrl+B) a node and raise strength_model to use it; 0.7–1.0 suits Turbo at CFG 1."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
